ClipSmith
=========

This project is an independent reimplementation built with ideas from:

  FunClip — https://github.com/modelscope/FunClip
  Copyright FunASR (https://github.com/alibaba-damo-academy/FunClip)
  Licensed under the MIT License.

Specifically, `backend/clipsmith/engine/funclip.py` adapts the recognition
entry point `VideoClipper.recog`, and the sentence/timestamp normalisation
follows the behaviour of FunClip's `videoclipper.py`. The web UI, job model,
selection strategies, rendering and export paths are original to ClipSmith.

Optional runtime dependencies keep their own licenses:

  FunASR   — MIT        https://github.com/modelscope/FunASR
  ffmpeg   — LGPL/GPL   https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

